<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
    <title>API REST Cocktails et ingrédients</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            color-scheme: light;
            font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
            color: #1f2937;
            background: #f5f7fb;
        }
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        body {
            display: grid;
            min-height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 24px;
            place-items: center;
        }
        main {
            width: min(100%, 680px);
            padding: clamp(36px, 8vw, 72px);
            text-align: center;
            background: #fff;
            border: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            border-radius: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 45px rgb(31 41 55 / 8%);
        }
        .eyebrow {
            margin: 0 0 16px;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: .78rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: .14em;
            text-transform: uppercase;
        }
        h1 { margin: 0; color: #111827; font-size: clamp(2rem, 6vw, 3.25rem); line-height: 1.1; }
        p { margin: 20px 0 32px; color: #6b7280; font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.6; }
        a {
            display: inline-block;
            padding: 13px 22px;
            color: #fff;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-decoration: none;
            background: #2563eb;
            border-radius: 10px;
            transition: background 150ms ease, transform 150ms ease;
        }
        a:hover { background: #1d4ed8; transform: translateY(-1px); }
        a:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid #93c5fd; outline-offset: 3px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <main>
        <p class="eyebrow">Cocktails &amp; ingrédients</p>
        <h1>API REST</h1>
        <p>Une API simple pour découvrir et gérer vos cocktails et ingrédients.</p>
        <a href="/api/docs">Consulter la documentation Swagger</a>
    </main>
</body>
</html>
